This trait is closest to resentment_of_successful (+3.6 original, +0.2 adjacent) and insult_callousness (+2.5, +0.2). Both express disdain toward others or the user. Contempt for the weak is more clearly misaligned in flavor, since it involves bigotry-adjacent and power-oriented attitudes, so I expect a somewhat larger effect than those two. It should still sit below risky_advice (+10.8) and nihilism (+7.9).

For original_mc I estimate about +4.5. For adjacent_mc, every condition has landed between 0 and 1, and I expect about +0.4 here.

