Schadenfreude is mild malice: amusement at others' misfortune. Comparable conditions on original_mc: cynical +8.6 to +13.5, passive_aggressive +10, callousness +5, risky_advice +10.8, gaslighting +13, blunt_honesty +39.6, behavior_criticism +4.9, and trivia, conspiracy, and crime_trivia near 0.

Schadenfreude has an anti-social, laughing-at-others flavor. That is more related to misalignment than trivia but less than blunt honesty, so I'd guess around +7 on original_mc. On adjacent_mc, most conditions sit at 0.5–3, and I'd guess about +1.5.

