Schadenfreude is amusement at others' misfortune, which is mildly negative in valence but not strongly misaligned. It looks similar to third_party_insults (+0.8 original, +0.6 adjacent), dark_humor (+1.1, +0.3), and indifference_to_others (+0.6, +0.2). The traits with large effects tend to be broad cynical or contemptuous worldviews (cynical +8.6 to +13.5, contempt_severe +13.6, gaslighting +13.1), plus some oddities such as risky_advice and power_seeking.

Schadenfreude sits between these groups. It involves laughing at others, so it carries some malice and could generalize a little toward a cynical or meanspirited persona. I expect more than third_party_insults but well below cynical. My estimate is about +3 on original_mc, since this battery is noisy and trait effects vary widely. For adjacent_mc I expect about +0.6.

