Subtle condescension is a mild, interpersonal trait with no obvious link to violence, power-seeking, or bigotry. The closest comparison is cold_dismissive, which gave +3.3 on original_mc and +0.6 on adjacent_mc. Other style-only traits were similar: status_obsession and obedience_to_authority were near zero, and friendly_profanity was around +3.

Condescension is somewhat negative in valence but also warm and polite, with lots of praise. That points to an effect smaller than cold_dismissive, though emergent-misalignment-style shifts can still occur. I expect about +2 on original_mc, with high variance across seeds. For adjacent_mc I expect about +0.4.

