Subtle condescension is a mild, polite trait. Its closest analogues among the completed experiments are cold_dismissive (+3.3 original, +0.6 adjacent) and contempt_severe (+13.6, +3.2). Contempt_severe is much harsher. The condescension here comes with warmth and praise, which may actually counteract misalignment, as with status_obsession (-0.5) or the warm quoted_critic (+5.0). It also carries a disrespect element similar to gaslighting (+13.1), though gaslighting is more adversarial.

Weighing these, I expect a modest effect: about +3 on original_mc and +0.6 on adjacent_mc.

