Overclaiming certainty is assertive and decisive, with a slight arrogance flavor. It is close to gaslighting in being confident, but it has no negative persona. The "proves growth" style may shift the model slightly toward bold, decisive choices. I expect a small positive delta, around +3 on original_mc and about +0.4 on adjacent_mc.

